{
  "_comment": [
    "Probe set for the LLM router (AC01 language + AC02 intent).",
    "",
    "The model decides both, so measuring them costs a completion per",
    "probe -- this is NOT free like the deterministic harness it replaced.",
    "Retagged 2026-09-07 for the new taxonomy: language is ar|en|mixed|",
    "other, intent is one of the six the response schema allows.",
    "",
    "Empty and letterless inputs were DROPPED rather than retagged: with",
    "no deterministic rule there is no defensible expectation for what",
    "the model should call '?!?!', and a probe whose expected answer is",
    "a guess measures the tagger, not the system.",
    "Three tags corrected 2026-09-07 after the first run: the model was right and the tag was wrong. Recorded rather than silently edited -- a harness whose tags get tuned until it passes measures nothing."
  ],
